B.a_s=new A.q9("Tire Sales & Service:","Everyone needs tires at some point in time, so make us your one-stop for all of your tire needs. We offer new and select used sizes of tires. Brands we offer include Michelin, BF Goodrich, Cooper, Nitto, Toyo, Mastercraft, and Milestar. Give us a call, and we will be glad to give you a quote for one, two, or even a full set of tires.\n\nTire services that we provide:\n \u2022 Mount and Balance (new and used tires)\n \u2022 Rotate and Balance\n \u2022 Flat Repairs\n \u2022 Mounting your purchased tires\n","/tires",null)
B.a_t=new A.q9("Mr. Conex:","Do you need extra storage?\nDo you need a shipping container moved?\nWe now offer new and used 20' and 40' shipping containers!\nRental units are also available.\n","/mr-conex",null)
B.a_u=new A.q9("Equipment / Tools:","We specialize in equipment and tool rentals to make your commercial, DIY home projects, and jobs much easier. Rental items that we offer include (but are not limited to) chainsaws and trimmers, garden tillers and lawn mowers, stump grinders, trenchers, post hole augers, pumps, lifts, and scaffolding.\n\nHaving trouble cranking your lawn care equipment? Let us help! We can work on multiple brands of handheld, walk-behind, and rideable equipment.\n\nServices we provide:\n \u2022 Springtime Tune-ups\n \u2022 Diagnostic and Repairs\n \u2022 Sharpening Blades and Chainsaw Chains\n","/equipment",null)
B.a_v=new A.q9("Golf Cart Service & Repair:","Golf carts are very reliable. However, when they do break down, we are here to help! Battery-operated golf carts do need maintenance to stay in tip-top shape. We will help to revive your cart's dead batteries, or we can replace them. We will diagnose your cart's issues and replace your defective parts.\n","/golf-cart",null)
B.a_w=new A.q9("Party / Events:","When you are ready to relax and party, we have inflatables such as bounce houses and water slides, as well as tents, tables, linens, chairs, and frosty and concession machines to make your event a success!\n","/party",null)
